WEBVTT

beat-1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The city must work before AI is switched on.

beat-2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The ordinary route and staffed service come first, so the original task remains possible for everyone.

beat-3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
After human approval, the reversible service opens only at the edge while the main route stays clear.

beat-4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Crowding or encroachment locks the equipment immediately and staff take over.

beat-5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Human takeover does not hide failure; it is infrastructure that keeps the city working.

beat-6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
After the equipment leaves, benches, shade, wayfinding and a continuously clear route remain.

beat-7
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Failure does not occupy the city.
